From 7006576afdfb56dd1604adb6a17846de3cb00ded Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wuzichun <wuzichun@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 07:31:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] [experiment] mooncake connector: v2a gather path
 (VLLM_MOONCAKE_GATHER)

Pack scattered KV blocks into a pinned staging buffer on the producer,
push as one descriptor over the CPU path, scatter back on the consumer
before marking requests received. V2 A/B (seeds 777/888/123):
-26~-35ms TTFT, bimodal eliminated.

Co-authored-by: Kimi Code <noreply@moonshot.cn>
